  {
    "id": "1a1c3fbe9c798b48",
    "source": "&689 A ragged patch on the side of one of the gas-bags. These stitches are probably a temporary measure until a more durable repair can be made, but given the age of this bucket you're unsure how likely that is to happen.",
    "target": "&689 一个气囊侧面破烂的补片。这些缝补应该只是临时措施，之后再作更牢靠的修复。不过，这艘破船这么老，你不确定还有没有那一天。",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "b5be7b6b1f817e3c",
    "source": "&690 A ragged patch on the side of one of the gas-bags. No more gas is escaping, suggesting that the pressure's reached equilibrium in this node.",
    "target": "&690 一个气囊侧面破烂的补片。已经没有气体逸出，说明这一段的压力达到了平衡。",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "736d4ea33b7d65ac",
    "source": "&691 A ragged patch on the side of one of the gas-bags, rippling as helium gas escapes from its high-pressure container.",
